  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project preparation for financing mini-grids and productive use of renewable energy in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide technical and logistical support to the Swedish-funded +Sol project for accelerating the preparation of a government-endorsed and GCF-compliant portfolio of green mini-grid projects and clusters in Zambezia and Manica provinces. Carry out field surveys and data collection for pre-identified mini-grid sites in Manica and Zambezia provinces Carry out on-site ESS screening in accordance with Mozambican regulations and GCF standards in Manica and Zambezia provinces Support to the land demarcation process for the construction of mini-grid sites Manica and Zambezia provinces Support to preparation Tender Package</narrative>
  </description>
